    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "等。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1885
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先把前后两句翻成最简单意思，再判断它们是什么关系。”",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1886
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 只背中文意思不够，必须看两边逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1887
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1888
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 读空前完整意思。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1889
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 读空后完整意思。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1890
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 判断同向/反向/因果/补充/替代。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1891
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 再选对应连接词。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1892
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1893
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1894
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1895
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 原因→结果：therefore/thus",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1896
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 前后反差：however/yet",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1897
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 不用A而用B：instead",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1898
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 再补一个理由：besides/moreover",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1899
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 连接词能准确描述两边关系。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1900
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果不认识连接词，先按句意方向排掉与逻辑明显相反的选项。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1901
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1902
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "前句说路线更长，后句说更安全。关系是转折，因此 however/yet 一类合适。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1903
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1904
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“前后都是真的”误当并列。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1905
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 不看标点。",
      "sourcePage": 68,
      "sourceIndex": 1906
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1907
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 关系是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1908
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 连接词位置和标点合适吗？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1909
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 69,
