      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1912
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 连接词先判关系，后选词。",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1913
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1915
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. although/but 表？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1916
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. therefore/so 表？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1917
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. besides/moreover 表？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1918
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. because/since 表？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1919
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 逻辑词题要同时看？",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1920
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 转折/让步；2. 结果；3. 补充递进；4. 原因；5. 前句关系+后句关系。",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1921
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C4”或题型关键词。—",
